2. OpenGWAS / IEU OpenGWAS — GWAS catalogue and API
================================================================================
  Home    : https://opengwas.io/  |  https://api.opengwas.io/
  Used by : tools/mr_gwas.py (offline catalogue lookup), and by MRAgent
            through the R package `ieugwasr`
  Terms   : Access requires a personal JWT obtained free of charge from
            <https://api.opengwas.io/>. Usage is subject to the OpenGWAS
            terms of use; this project ships no GWAS summary statistics.

  `opengwas.csv` (the offline catalogue index, ~10 MB) is NOT distributed in
  this git repository (see .gitignore). `install.py` downloads it from the
  MRAgent repository into a local cache at:
      ~/.cache/mr-agent/opengwas.csv
  Users who do not run the installer and never call `--fetch` will not have
  this file, and offline lookup will degrade to online mode.

