================================================================================
Note on the upstream UMLS key
================================================================================
  The upstream MRAgent package ships a hard-coded UMLS API key inside
  `agent_tool.py`. This skill deliberately does NOT reproduce that key in any
  file. The skill runner disables synonym expansion by default. If you
  explicitly enable `--synonyms`, upstream MRAgent uses its own embedded key;
  the upstream API currently offers no way to override it. The standalone
  `mr_synonyms.py` tool requires the user's own key.
